## 1. Bootstrap (do this first, every project)

**Apply this before any other logging or flow changes.**

### POM dependency

```xml
<dependency>
    <groupId>${project.parent.groupId}</groupId>
    <artifactId>log4j-datadog-appender</artifactId>
    <version>1.0.1</version>
</dependency>
```

### Configuration packages

- **packages:** `com.insulet.datadog,org.apache.logging.log4j` (required for DataDogLog4jAppender)

### DataDogLog4jAppender

- **name:** `DATADOG`
- **endpoint:** `${sys:DATADOG_HOST}` (set as a system property at CloudHub deploy time — do NOT hardcode a URL)
- **apiKey:** `${sys:DATADOG_API_KEY}` (set via environment or deployment properties)
- **source:** `MuleSoft`
- **host:** `${hostName}`
- **service:** `${project.artifactId}`
- **apiLayer:** `${sys:anypoint.platform.visualizer.layer}`
- **environment:** `${sys:mule.env}`
- **ddTags:** `integration:MuleSoft-To-DataDog`
- **batchSize:** `500`, **maxBytesPerBatch:** `5242880`, **flushIntervalMs:** `5000`
- **connectTimeoutMs:** `2000`, **readTimeoutMs:** `10000`
- **retryEnabled:** `true`, **retryCount:** `3`
- **enableCircuitBreaker:** `true`, **circuitBreakerFailures:** `5`, **circuitBreakerOpenMs:** `30000`
- **compressPayloads:** `true`
- **PatternLayout:** `%-5p %d [%t] [processor: %X{processorPath}; event: %X{correlationId}] %c: %m%n`

### AsyncLogger categories (Insulet Custom Logger Connector)

- `com.insulet.general` — level INFO (without-payload logs)
- `com.insulet.maskedpayload` — level INFO (masked payload logs)
- `com.insulet.encryptedpayload` — level **DEBUG** (encrypted payload logs)

### AsyncRoot

- Include both appenders: `<AppenderRef ref="file"/>` and `<AppenderRef ref="DATADOG"/>`
- **PROD:** Set all three AsyncLogger categories to WARN (no leftover DEBUG)

### Canonical `log4j2.xml` skeleton (embedded — no external reference required)

```xml
<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Configuration status="INFO" name="cloudhub"
    packages="com.insulet.datadog,org.apache.logging.log4j">
    <Appenders>
        <RollingFile name="file" fileName="${sys:mule.home}${sys:file.separator}logs${sys:file.separator}${project.artifactId}.log"
                     filePattern="${sys:mule.home}${sys:file.separator}logs${sys:file.separator}${project.artifactId}-%i.log">
            <PatternLayout pattern="%-5p %d [%t] [processor: %X{processorPath}; event: %X{correlationId}] %c: %m%n"/>
            <SizeBasedTriggeringPolicy size="10 MB"/>
            <DefaultRolloverStrategy max="10"/>
        </RollingFile>
        <DataDogLog4jAppender name="DATADOG"
              endpoint="${sys:DATADOG_HOST}"
              apiKey="${sys:DATADOG_API_KEY}"
              source="MuleSoft"
              host="${hostName}"
              service="${project.artifactId}"
              apiLayer="${sys:anypoint.platform.visualizer.layer}"
              environment="${sys:mule.env}"
              ddTags="integration:MuleSoft-To-DataDog"
              batchSize="500"
              maxBytesPerBatch="5242880"
              flushIntervalMs="5000"
              connectTimeoutMs="2000"
              readTimeoutMs="10000"
              retryEnabled="true"
              retryCount="3"
              enableCircuitBreaker="true"
              circuitBreakerFailures="5"
              circuitBreakerOpenMs="30000"
              compressPayloads="true">
            <PatternLayout pattern="%-5p %d [%t] [processor: %X{processorPath}; event: %X{correlationId}] %c: %m%n" />
        </DataDogLog4jAppender>
    </Appenders>
    <Loggers>
        <AsyncLogger name="org.mule.service.http" level="WARN"/>
        <AsyncLogger name="org.mule.extension.http" level="WARN"/>
        <AsyncLogger name="org.mule.runtime.core.internal.processor.LoggerMessageProcessor" level="INFO"/>
        <AsyncLogger name="com.insulet.general" level="INFO" />
        <AsyncLogger name="com.insulet.maskedpayload" level="INFO" />
        <AsyncLogger name="com.insulet.encryptedpayload" level="DEBUG" />
        <AsyncRoot level="INFO">
            <AppenderRef ref="file"/>
            <AppenderRef ref="DATADOG"/>
        </AsyncRoot>
    </Loggers>
</Configuration>
```

> **PROD override:** Set all three `com.insulet.*` AsyncLogger categories to `level="WARN"` in the PROD `log4j2.xml`. Do not leave any at INFO or DEBUG in production.

